":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-07T06:06:26Z","updated_at":"2018-09-07T06:06:26Z","body":"It happens because the quickfix window has `winfixheight` set. If you `:set nowinfixheight` immediately after the `:copen` step, the window height only \"grows\" once. Alternatively the behavior can be simulated with a regular `:split` by first setting `winfixheight` in that window.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/419332906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/419558145","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/3608#issuecomment-419558145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/3608","id":419558145,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQxOTU1ODE0NQ==","user":{"login":"rf-","id":345106,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NTEwNg==","avatar_url":"https://avata